    <h2>Why Each Meta Tag Matters</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><b>Charset:</b> Helps display characters correctly, such as ₹ and é.</li>
        <li><b>Viewport:</b> Helps websites display properly on mobile devices.</li>
        <li><b>Description:</b> Provides a short summary of a webpage.</li>
        <li><b>Author:</b> Identifies the author of the webpage.</li>
        <li><b>Keywords:</b> Describes the topics covered by the page.</li>
        <li><b>Robots:</b> Gives search engines instructions about indexing.</li>
        <li><b>Open Graph:</b> Helps control link previews on social platforms.</li>
        <li><b>Theme Color:</b> Suggests a browser theme color on supported devices.</li>
    </ul>
